// JS expression that wraps \`expr\` in the config's provider chain (if any).
// \`{"$ref": "X"}\` in a prop value emits \`G.X\` instead of a JSON literal \u2014
// for providers that need a bundle export (e.g. \`theme={LIGHT_THEME}\`).
